Switch Player includes code adapted from the projects below.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NX Play
https://github.com/varyform/nx-native-wrapper

Used for game names and art: the eShop title list lookup and the Nintendo-CDN-only image
download in "Application Files/titledb.py", from
Packages/NXPlayKit/Sources/NXPlayKit/Model/Artwork.swift.

The Python dependency list in "Application Files/nxnative-python/pyproject.toml" and the
Homebrew dependency list in "Application Files/Brewfile" are adapted from NX Play's
pyproject.toml and Brewfile. The prerequisite checks in "Application Files/prerequisites.py"
are adapted from NX Play's bin/setup.

The Out of date check, Copy.freshness in "Application Files/nxnative.py", is adapted from
NX Play's ask_update() and no_local_commits() in its nxplay script.

